{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bbaaa99c-93cd-85fa-ba42-4446f4b8c8b7",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:44:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:41:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Beverly Lawton. I am calling about the streetlights. Um, I have written it down, so I will read it slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. I'll jot it down as you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. On Friday night, in the storm, all the lights on my block went out. The whole block was dark at night. Saturday night also dark. Now it is Monday and they are still not working."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the whole block, the streetlights are out since Friday night. And that's the street lights, not the power to the houses, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. The houses have power. Only the street lights. [pause] I think it is the pole. There is a pole at the corner, and it is leaning a little. I would like to ask for a crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Leaning pole at the corner, whole block's lights out. What's the address you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is 143 Callender Avenue. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty-three Callender. And which corner is the pole on, closest to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, let me look at my paper. [pause] It is the pole in front of the house, next to my mailbox. Not the corner. I am sorry, I said corner before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, in front of your house by the mailbox. Is there anything hanging down, any wires low to the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I do not see wires on the ground. Only the pole is leaning and the light is dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at that pole and the lights on the block. If you ever do see a wire down, stay away from it and call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. Also, I have one more thing written here. The children walk to the school on this street in the morning. This week there is a school spirit day, and the students wear pajamas. It is dark when they walk, and they are in pajamas, so it is harder to see them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a good point, I'll note that the kids are walking through there in the morning. That helps with the priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when the crew's been out? I have a number here, or I can take a new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. My number is 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-nine. Beverly Lawton, one forty-three Callender, streetlights out on the block, leaning pole in front of the house. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:44:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:44:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Crews are still working through storm calls, but this one's in the queue. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
